# Route: guide 50 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to
# 60, 37 quests, 2.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Swamp of Sorrows, Redridge Mountains, Badlands, Western Plaguelands,
# Eastern Plaguelands, Hillsbrad Foothills, Azshara, Un'Goro Crater, Feralas,
# Thunder Bluff, Durotar, Moonglade): Stagalbog -> Stonard -> Splinterspear
# Junction -> Lakeshire -> Agmond's End -> Kargath -> The Dustbowl -> Kargath
# -> The Writhing Haunt -> Darrowshire -> Tarren Mill -> Ravencrest Monument
# -> Lakkari Tar Pits -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): It's Dangerous to Go Alone (3962;
# Blazerunner 56).
#
# Left out: Gahrron's Withering Cauldron (5227): the route takes them here but
# cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Find the Gems and Power Source (2339), Disharmony of Fire
# (3907), Commander Gor'shak (3981), The Rise of the Machines (4063), KILL ON
# SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves (4081), KILL ON SIGHT: High Ranking Dark Iron
# Officials (4082), Operation: Death to Angerforge (4132), Lost Thunderbrew
# Recipe (4134), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), The Pack Mistress (4724), Kibler's
# Exotic Pets (4729), The Darkstone Tablet (4768), En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862),
# Warlord's Command (4903), Operative Bijou (4981), Doctor Theolen Krastinov,
# the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus
# Illusions (6569), Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The
# Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243),
# The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282),
# Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Ramstein (6163), Dead
# Man's Plea (8945), Anthion's Old Friend (8948), The Grave Knight (96986),
# Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends (7481),
# Lethtendris's Web (7489), Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102),
# Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723).

